WEBVTT

00:29.210 --> 00:30.090
<b>Hell's Paradise</b>

00:30.130 --> 00:35.490
<i>A faint flower was blooming 
unnoticed by anyone</i>

00:35.490 --> 00:40.490
<i>Not a burning red, 
but flickering serenely in red</i>

00:40.490 --> 00:45.840
<i>I've been pausing for a long time 
dragging my past at my feet</i>

00:45.840 --> 00:48.440
<i>If I break free from this ambivalence,</i>

00:48.440 --> 00:51.850
<i>will I be able to bloom by its side?</i>

00:51.850 --> 00:54.490
<i>The future is slipping away 
between my fingers</i>

00:54.490 --> 00:57.010
<i>What mistake did I make 
to pay this price?</i>

00:57.010 --> 01:01.860
<i>Always hurting myself</i>

01:01.860 --> 01:07.210
<i>and hesitant even to a small joy</i>

01:07.720 --> 01:09.410
<i>I want to stop now</i>

01:09.410 --> 01:11.930
<i>The flower just bloomed in dignity</i>

01:11.930 --> 01:14.550
<i>and that was all I needed to be happy</i>

01:14.550 --> 01:19.320
<i>I just wanted to protect this one flower</i>

01:19.670 --> 01:22.380
<i>Wishing to be strong, I</i>

01:22.380 --> 01:25.040
<i>picked up the vulnerability 
I had once cast away</i>

01:25.040 --> 01:26.990
<i>Can't break free from the ambivalence</i>

01:26.990 --> 01:30.180
<i>In ambivalence, I become myself</i>

01:30.180 --> 01:32.890
<i>Like rooting strongly into the soil</i>

01:32.890 --> 01:35.440
<i>like swaying ephemerally to the wind</i>

01:35.440 --> 01:38.670
<i>I'm slowly loosening myself to bloom</i>

01:38.530 --> 01:41.660
<b>Hell's Paradise</b>

01:45.540 --> 01:51.010
<b>Humans and Sages</b>

01:45.850 --> 01:50.130
The situation is complicated, 
but what we must do remains the same.

01:50.130 --> 01:52.880
First, acquire the Elixir of Life.

01:52.880 --> 01:55.430
Second, escape the island alive.

01:56.140 --> 01:58.890
Let's begin by reviewing only 
the information we need.

01:58.890 --> 02:01.740
We won't consider 
the mysteries of the island.

02:01.740 --> 02:05.690
What's most important is 
how we'll escape the island.

02:05.690 --> 02:07.690
So, how do we escape?

02:07.690 --> 02:10.160
Mei-san knows.

02:14.130 --> 02:16.770
Yes, yes. I see.

02:18.060 --> 02:20.220
Horai is a massive citadel.

02:20.660 --> 02:23.520
It's apparently modeled 
after the Epang Palace in China.

02:23.950 --> 02:28.960
It was built to complete the Elixir 
and receive the first emperor.

02:28.960 --> 02:32.350
In other words, entering or exiting 
the island itself isn't impossible.

02:32.790 --> 02:35.590
However, there are monsters 
in the surrounding waters.

02:35.800 --> 02:39.600
Their purpose is to ensure 
the island's creatures don't leave.

02:40.670 --> 02:42.350
That's those big guys I saw.

02:42.620 --> 02:45.710
Surely they're less dangerous 
than the Tensen.

02:45.710 --> 02:50.110
Would humans on small boats stand 
a chance against monsters at sea?

02:50.110 --> 02:55.610
Not even the greatest swordsman 
could kill or escape from them.

02:57.620 --> 03:01.640
The assumption is that we 
won't be fighting the Tensen.

03:01.990 --> 03:05.060
We'll quickly steal the Elixir 
while avoiding detection

03:05.060 --> 03:06.620
and leave the island by boat.

03:06.620 --> 03:09.770
Our goal is to escape the island.

03:09.770 --> 03:12.510
There are boats and 
a sluice gate beneath Horai.

03:12.510 --> 03:17.490
The monsters have been taught not to 
attack boats leaving from there.

03:19.090 --> 03:20.640
<i>A sluice gate...</i>

03:20.640 --> 03:23.640
<i>That must be the presence 
I detected by the shore.</i>

03:24.000 --> 03:26.520
Do you know where the Elixir is?

03:27.360 --> 03:29.450
Probably.

03:30.900 --> 03:35.910
Rien and my research lab.

03:36.900 --> 03:38.280
Either way,

03:38.750 --> 03:41.120
we'll be passing through enemy territory.

03:41.580 --> 03:44.870
We don't have much time, 
but we should prepare as much as we can.

03:44.870 --> 03:47.250
So, Gabimaru and Yuzuriha...

03:47.730 --> 03:49.570
Teach us your stealth techniques.

03:49.570 --> 03:51.220
Who, me?

03:52.760 --> 03:55.000
You mean my charms?

03:55.730 --> 03:57.750
No, regarding tao.

04:01.100 --> 04:02.390
We'll start with

04:02.390 --> 04:07.770
<b>Substitution</b>

04:03.250 --> 04:07.770
dampening your tao during substitution.

04:08.020 --> 04:09.200
Why?

04:09.200 --> 04:10.900
Those were Sen-chan's! Give them back!

04:10.900 --> 04:12.780
Now, now, students.

04:12.780 --> 04:16.150
A picture is worth a bunch of words, 
or something. Watch this.

04:21.220 --> 04:23.910
See? It ends when you speak, though.

04:23.910 --> 04:27.830
Dampening your tao is equivalent 
to dampening your existence.

04:28.160 --> 04:32.880
It worked on the Tensen, 
so it's perfect for sneaking in.

04:33.140 --> 04:36.510
Okay, everyone. 
Take deep breaths and focus.

04:38.520 --> 04:39.370
Ow!

04:40.330 --> 04:41.590
What was that for?

04:41.590 --> 04:43.450
Your tao was agitated.

04:44.220 --> 04:46.700
Keep your mind still, no matter what.

04:50.100 --> 04:53.040
Tao works in a surprisingly physical way.

04:53.040 --> 04:56.170
As in sumo wrestling or judo, 
forces can be deflected.

04:56.170 --> 04:58.690
You can even turn 
an opponent's tao against them.

04:58.960 --> 05:02.070
I even came up with a strategy 
that utilizes compatibilities.

05:02.070 --> 05:05.530
The similarities between hua jin 
in martial arts and the rotation of tao

05:04.180 --> 05:06.610
He's rather logical, isn't he?

05:05.910 --> 05:08.830
strongly suggest that 
any force can be neutralized.

05:06.610 --> 05:07.800
You mean he's just a nerd.

05:08.830 --> 05:11.290
Start by dislocating your neck.

05:11.290 --> 05:12.420
We can't do that!

05:14.010 --> 05:16.060
Those who can't will be first to die.

05:16.570 --> 05:18.420
That's how we trained in the village.

05:20.180 --> 05:22.180
Okay, focus.

05:22.600 --> 05:24.690
Don't react, no matter 
what's done to you.

05:24.690 --> 05:27.930
Dislocate all the joints in your body.

05:27.930 --> 05:30.180
Don't react, don't react.

05:30.180 --> 05:32.810
Stop your heart without killing yourself.

05:37.130 --> 05:39.540
Why aren't you guys tired?

05:39.880 --> 05:42.510
Good tao control reduces exhaustion.

05:43.220 --> 05:45.490
How come you have 
good control right away?

05:45.960 --> 05:47.880
Who knows? Talent, perhaps?

05:50.020 --> 05:54.210
<i>I feel different since then.</i>

05:59.650 --> 06:03.290
I bet I could easily score 
a hit on you right now.

06:06.050 --> 06:09.650
Those are fighting words, man-woman.

06:08.680 --> 06:13.910
It's strange. At first, 
our statuses were different.

06:09.650 --> 06:12.490
But if you're tired, we don't have to.

06:12.490 --> 06:14.990
If you want a fight, I'm game.

06:14.170 --> 06:17.340
But now, we're working together 
to achieve the same goal.

06:18.370 --> 06:23.440
<i>I can't believe I don't 
want anyone here to die.</i>

06:21.570 --> 06:24.240
If you fail to land a blow on me,

06:24.240 --> 06:27.520
I'll make you wear a 
Chinese dress, man-woman.

06:27.520 --> 06:28.750
I'll kill you.

06:28.750 --> 06:29.920
The same...

06:28.750 --> 06:32.270
Interesting. Can you even do that?

06:32.270 --> 06:34.340
Kill me if you can.

06:32.910 --> 06:34.340
Wait, wait.

06:34.340 --> 06:34.920
Huh?

06:34.920 --> 06:37.120
Let's assign groups first.

06:37.540 --> 06:40.170
<b>Fire</b>

06:38.160 --> 06:40.170
Blade Dragon, stand there.

06:40.170 --> 06:42.170
What? Don't tell me what to do.

06:42.170 --> 06:43.640
Don't argue!

06:44.030 --> 06:45.800
Gabimaru, you, too.

06:45.800 --> 06:47.090
<b>Earth</b>

06:46.290 --> 06:48.410
Yuzuriha and Toma, stand there.

06:48.410 --> 06:49.960
Yeah, yeah.

06:50.940 --> 06:53.120
Nice braid, missy.

06:53.120 --> 06:54.350
I'll kill you.

06:54.350 --> 06:55.600
Fuchi.

06:56.110 --> 06:57.070
Mei.

06:57.600 --> 07:03.240
<b>Wood</b>

06:57.600 --> 07:03.240
<b>Fire</b>

06:57.600 --> 07:03.240
<b>Earth</b>

06:57.600 --> 07:03.240
<b>Metal</b>

06:57.600 --> 07:03.240
<b>Water</b>

06:58.020 --> 07:03.240
We should know our tao's attributes 
for when we encounter the Tensen.

07:03.240 --> 07:06.200
Sagiri, like me, your attribute is wood.

07:05.240 --> 07:07.240
<b>Wood</b>

07:07.240 --> 07:09.300
Gabimaru and the Blade Dragon are fire.

07:10.740 --> 07:14.000
Then there's water, metal, and earth.

07:14.000 --> 07:16.820
Each of these attributes 
influence the others.

07:18.500 --> 07:21.500
<b>Restoration</b>

07:18.500 --> 07:21.500
<b>Hindering</b>

07:21.500 --> 07:23.510
<b>Restoration</b>

07:21.500 --> 07:23.510
<b>Hindering</b>

07:24.250 --> 07:27.010
Enhancing another's tao 
is called restoration.

07:27.380 --> 07:30.140
Weakening it is called hindering.

07:30.140 --> 07:33.080
Do we know the Tensen's attributes?

07:33.080 --> 07:35.640
I do.

07:37.540 --> 07:38.750
I remember.

07:39.230 --> 07:46.650
<b>Wood</b>

07:39.230 --> 07:46.650
<b>Fire</b>

07:39.230 --> 07:46.650
<b>Earth</b>

07:39.230 --> 07:46.650
<b>Metal</b>

07:39.230 --> 07:46.650
<b>Water</b>

07:39.230 --> 07:41.350
Ju Fa, fire.

07:41.350 --> 07:43.510
Tao Fa, wood.

07:43.510 --> 07:46.250
Zhu Jin, Ran, water.

07:46.250 --> 07:48.170
Gui Fa, metal.

07:48.540 --> 07:51.240
Mu Dan, Rien, earth.

07:51.240 --> 07:54.220
If your tao hinders your opponent's, 
your attacks will be effective.

07:55.000 --> 07:59.150
But in the opposite case, you cannot win.

07:59.970 --> 08:02.740
Abandon everything and run.

08:06.710 --> 08:09.260
I assigned groups based on compatibility.

08:09.260 --> 08:13.160
One group to secure an escape route, 
and one group to acquire the Elixir.

08:13.600 --> 08:17.020
Speed and stealth are key 
to the Elixir group.

08:17.020 --> 08:19.560
It should be a small group 
proficient with tao.

08:19.560 --> 08:21.060
Wait, are you for real?

08:21.060 --> 08:23.600
The Elixir group's way more dangerous!

08:23.600 --> 08:24.650
No objections.

08:24.970 --> 08:28.090
The escape group will need people 
to secure a boat beneath Horai

08:28.090 --> 08:30.400
and open the sluice gate.

08:30.400 --> 08:34.370
Three people for each task 
should be enough.

08:35.430 --> 08:36.690
Sensei...

08:37.710 --> 08:39.860
It's just, well...

08:39.860 --> 08:42.000
It's all right, Nurugai.

08:43.240 --> 08:44.670
I haven't forgotten.

08:46.140 --> 08:47.200
Okay.

08:49.220 --> 08:51.290
According to the bonsai guy...

08:51.290 --> 08:52.590
Not bonsai.

08:52.590 --> 08:55.100
You want to leave the island, too, right?

08:56.050 --> 08:57.050
Yes.

08:57.940 --> 09:04.170
Then instead of waiting for the Elixir 
group, you could leave before us.

09:04.170 --> 09:05.020
Wait.

09:05.020 --> 09:05.730
Huh?

09:06.990 --> 09:09.360
Are you sure this is what you want?

09:09.360 --> 09:10.290
What?

09:10.290 --> 09:12.030
Gabi!

09:12.030 --> 09:15.780
Exactly. The Elixir group 
is just so danger...

09:17.240 --> 09:20.970
Do you want to leave the island?

09:22.620 --> 09:25.930
Isn't there something 
you want to do first?

09:25.930 --> 09:28.780
You could've escaped 
the island by yourself.

09:30.120 --> 09:31.920
But you didn't.

09:34.210 --> 09:38.520
We didn't get to hear the whole 
story last time, but tell us now.

09:43.150 --> 09:44.900
I'll translate.

09:47.760 --> 09:53.910
I think what Rien doing bad.

09:53.910 --> 09:56.400
Killed lots and lots.

09:57.420 --> 10:00.950
Why Grandmaster Shufu not stop them?

10:01.410 --> 10:04.790
I want to leave island. Everything scary.

10:05.850 --> 10:12.540
But I want to see Rien and 
Grandmaster one more time.

10:13.530 --> 10:16.700
Want to ask why they changed.

10:16.700 --> 10:20.190
They used to be nice.

10:20.190 --> 10:22.310
They were nice, but then...

10:24.770 --> 10:28.270
So you'll put yourself in danger 
to speak with the Tensen,

10:28.650 --> 10:30.570
and then what?

10:31.990 --> 10:33.320
Then...

10:33.870 --> 10:39.450
Then I want to leave island 
and live normal life.

10:42.280 --> 10:44.620
Let's protect our normal.

10:44.620 --> 10:47.830
Peacefully and honestly.

10:48.730 --> 10:53.420
I know it's dangerous, 
but just want to look.

10:53.420 --> 10:54.930
See them again.

10:58.260 --> 10:59.500
Then let's go.

11:00.530 --> 11:02.960
If you just want to look, 
that might be possible.

11:02.960 --> 11:03.980
But...

11:03.980 --> 11:08.360
Otherwise, your normal will never begin.

11:09.940 --> 11:11.630
Let me handle the journey.

11:11.630 --> 11:13.830
I promise I'll take you 
to your destination.

11:21.740 --> 11:24.450
Now the sage's ritual is complete.

11:27.460 --> 11:31.710
So, was there any purpose 
to this grand ritual?

11:31.710 --> 11:35.240
Who knows? We've always done it.

11:35.240 --> 11:40.890
New doshi and anyone allowed to 
enter the castle performs it.

11:42.430 --> 11:44.920
That's much better.

11:44.920 --> 11:47.690
Shall we introduce ourselves again?

11:47.690 --> 11:48.600
I'm Tao—

11:48.600 --> 11:49.710
Don't speak your name.

11:50.310 --> 11:52.940
This livestock isn't worth it.

11:53.290 --> 11:55.820
Simply being in the same room 
as it makes me want to puke.

11:56.350 --> 11:58.820
Likewise, you weed.

12:06.000 --> 12:08.730
You should've killed me then.

12:09.250 --> 12:12.790
I can see your movements now.

12:13.270 --> 12:14.400
Stop.

12:14.940 --> 12:18.690
That man is a research 
subject and my guest.

12:18.690 --> 12:21.300
I will not allow you to harm him.

12:21.300 --> 12:24.060
Come, Chobe.

12:25.240 --> 12:26.880
Where are we going?

12:26.880 --> 12:29.340
I'm going to examine 
your tao in great detail.

12:30.310 --> 12:32.780
This place is pretty elaborate.

12:32.780 --> 12:34.700
It's a feng shui design.

12:34.700 --> 12:37.090
Extensions and renovations are made

12:37.090 --> 12:39.540
according to tao singularities, 
or dragon holes,

12:39.540 --> 12:41.570
and the paths it follows, 
or dragon veins.

12:41.570 --> 12:42.940
What?

12:42.940 --> 12:47.580
You'll understand eventually. 
You have a knack for tao.

12:48.900 --> 12:53.240
<i>I was powerless against that guy before,</i>

12:53.920 --> 12:55.510
<i>but I'm different now.</i>

12:56.690 --> 12:58.830
<i>I've clearly adapted to it.</i>

12:58.830 --> 13:00.510
<i>My power has grown.</i>

13:01.760 --> 13:05.960
<i>That's why I can tell 
how dangerous this guy is.</i>

13:05.960 --> 13:08.270
<i>They're different 
from the rest of the Tensen.</i>

13:08.680 --> 13:11.380
<i>I need to learn more 
about their weaknesses.</i>

13:11.380 --> 13:13.730
<i>I can't beat them right now.</i>

13:14.280 --> 13:16.050
<i>Not right now, anyway.</i>

13:17.830 --> 13:20.230
This is my research lab.

13:29.580 --> 13:31.710
<i>What is this thing?</i>

13:32.050 --> 13:34.250
Banko, the Waitanhua Flower.

13:34.790 --> 13:38.890
Tan is tao extracted from humans 
who have become flowers,

13:38.890 --> 13:42.530
but only a meager amount can be 
extracted from a single human.

13:42.530 --> 13:46.760
But Banko can refine large 
amounts of tan at once.

13:50.910 --> 13:53.820
However, it is difficult to preserve tan,

13:53.820 --> 13:58.900
as over time, the flower's tao 
completely consumes the human's tao.

13:58.900 --> 14:01.310
Even Banko will wilt eventually,

14:01.900 --> 14:05.370
before I achieve the quality 
and quantity I seek.

14:05.990 --> 14:09.240
Which is why I want your rare tao.

14:09.240 --> 14:10.660
Assist me.

14:11.820 --> 14:15.630
<i>They want a huge amount of tan... 
for what purpose?</i>

14:17.530 --> 14:20.340
<i>Are they going to turn Toma 
into this thing?</i>

14:20.340 --> 14:23.300
That's it. Those undulations in your tao.

14:23.760 --> 14:26.150
I've seen countless humans until now,

14:26.150 --> 14:28.640
but your waves are 
different from all the rest.

14:28.640 --> 14:30.270
They're beautiful.

14:31.020 --> 14:33.020
Don't worry.

14:33.020 --> 14:34.790
I just want to study you.

14:35.520 --> 14:37.770
I won't kill you.

14:38.120 --> 14:40.200
I'll only use a part of you.

14:40.200 --> 14:42.420
Since you'll regenerate, 
it won't be a problem.

14:43.030 --> 14:46.160
Naturally, you'll train 
in tao use as well.

14:46.160 --> 14:49.530
That will produce greater results 
for my experiments.

14:54.900 --> 14:56.790
Bring it on.

15:16.060 --> 15:17.310
You must be joking!

15:17.310 --> 15:19.570
We're sneaking in tonight?

15:19.570 --> 15:21.440
We should be sleeping tonight.

15:21.790 --> 15:24.570
A shinobi strikes when the time is right.

15:24.570 --> 15:27.480
Unlike you, I'm human.

15:28.160 --> 15:30.200
I think it's good idea.

15:30.600 --> 15:33.130
Flowers close at night.

15:33.130 --> 15:36.460
Our tao weakest then.

15:36.460 --> 15:41.380
And we should probably act 
before the new arrivals catch up to us.

15:41.380 --> 15:45.730
We got more rest than we've been 
getting, so I'm okay with that.

15:45.730 --> 15:49.390
Same. I want to get out of here ASAP.

15:49.720 --> 15:51.490
It doesn't matter if we're tired.

15:55.040 --> 15:57.850
I don't want to keep her 
waiting any longer.

15:58.950 --> 16:01.410
We'll leave first 
and prepare the way for you.

16:08.490 --> 16:10.990
Once we've confirmed the situation, 
we'll send a signal.

16:11.270 --> 16:13.180
A red flame means stop.

16:13.180 --> 16:14.440
A blue flame means...

16:18.190 --> 16:19.500
Proceed as planned.

16:20.330 --> 16:21.330
Let's go.

16:22.390 --> 16:24.270
It's all about to end.

16:24.270 --> 16:27.880
You knew from the start 
that this mission would be short.

16:28.490 --> 16:30.290
We're leaving the island tonight.

16:33.140 --> 16:37.520
Horai is divided into 
a vast interior and exterior.

16:37.520 --> 16:40.150
We fought Mu Dan in the exterior.

16:40.150 --> 16:43.540
There are several palaces 
for the Tensen in the interior.

16:44.150 --> 16:48.650
Tensen's castle designed 
for their training.

16:49.000 --> 16:50.420
Bochu palace.

16:50.420 --> 16:54.660
For Ju Fa and Tao Fa, who seek 
immortality through intercourse.

16:54.660 --> 16:56.030
Taisoku palace.

16:56.030 --> 17:00.040
For Zhu Jin, who seeks immortality 
through breathing techniques.

17:00.040 --> 17:01.520
Doin palace.

17:01.520 --> 17:04.920
For Ran, who seeks immortality 
through physical exercise.

17:04.920 --> 17:06.340
Shuitsu palace.

17:06.340 --> 17:09.920
For Gui Fa, who seeks immortality 
through meditation.

17:09.920 --> 17:11.550
Shuten palace.

17:11.550 --> 17:15.930
For Mu Dan, who seeks immortality 
through tao of pressure points and organs.

17:15.930 --> 17:20.940
In other words, the sages perform 
their own specialized research.

17:21.300 --> 17:23.060
They share information.

17:23.060 --> 17:24.390
I see.

17:24.390 --> 17:26.570
Yeah, I see.

17:26.570 --> 17:30.570
Finally, Elixir in rentan palace.

17:31.110 --> 17:33.190
Rien's research lab.

17:35.200 --> 17:38.080
But Rien not there at night.

17:38.920 --> 17:43.090
Waitanhua closes at night. 
Can't do research.

17:44.080 --> 17:47.090
Rien in main palace at night.

17:47.390 --> 17:49.590
Grandmaster Shufu's castle.

17:49.590 --> 17:51.400
There's one key point.

17:51.820 --> 17:54.590
Whatever you do, don't fight the Tensen.

17:54.590 --> 17:56.830
If we do, our plan will fail.

17:57.520 --> 18:00.110
There's a problem with going at midnight.

18:00.110 --> 18:03.140
The moonlight won't reach 
inside the structures.

18:03.140 --> 18:06.410
We need to know 
the floor plans in advance.

18:07.070 --> 18:11.240
But don't the Tensen repeatedly 
renovate their castle?

18:12.010 --> 18:14.250
It's impossible to steal anything

18:14.250 --> 18:16.160
if we don't know and can't see 
where we're going.

18:16.160 --> 18:20.310
Actually, isn't that why you 
chose these groups, Gabimaru?

18:20.750 --> 18:21.870
Yes.

18:22.150 --> 18:24.060
We'll see with our tao, not with our eyes.

18:26.010 --> 18:28.040
The tao of inanimate objects is faint,

18:28.040 --> 18:30.260
but if you can detect it, 
you can identify their structure.

18:30.260 --> 18:33.510
That's why those of us skilled 
in tao detection were chosen.

18:33.510 --> 18:35.600
If tan is made from humans,

18:35.600 --> 18:38.760
then there should be many corpses 
in the research lab.

18:38.760 --> 18:43.230
Wherever we detect that tao 
the strongest is the rentan palace.

18:49.020 --> 18:51.210
If it'll disrupt your tao, 
you don't have to look.

18:52.530 --> 18:54.960
I'm fine. I'm used to it.

18:55.910 --> 18:57.620
I'm fine, too.

18:57.930 --> 18:59.480
<i>They're so calm.</i>

19:00.210 --> 19:01.750
<i>These are true shinobi.</i>

19:02.750 --> 19:06.710
If we dampen our tao inside 
the castle like Yuzuriha,

19:07.030 --> 19:08.720
the guards won't notice us.

19:10.670 --> 19:12.450
Even when we kill them...

19:28.340 --> 19:31.480
If we're quick, the others won't notice.

19:36.530 --> 19:38.270
<i>They're so dexterous.</i>

19:39.380 --> 19:43.930
<i>A few moments from now, 
we'll be leaving the island on a boat.</i>

19:46.540 --> 19:48.970
<i>The Elixir is in here.</i>

19:49.870 --> 19:51.860
<i>I don't sense any Tensen.</i>

19:58.500 --> 20:02.400
<i>The structure is simple. 
It's sparsely decorated.</i>

20:18.420 --> 20:23.120
So you also thought to conceal 
yourself by dampening your tao.

20:24.490 --> 20:26.250
R-Ran?

20:28.170 --> 20:31.500
I thought you might've been 
behind this, Sister.

20:32.520 --> 20:34.630
I'm glad you seem well.

20:34.970 --> 20:36.630
How?

20:36.630 --> 20:40.150
We received information 
from a certain man.

20:41.390 --> 20:43.770
Roughly 20 people landed.

20:43.770 --> 20:46.110
Half of them possess 
exceptional abilities.

20:46.110 --> 20:51.400
In other words, like him, 
they possess exceptional tao.

20:51.400 --> 20:55.260
Did you expose your allies because 
you couldn't withstand the research?

20:55.260 --> 20:56.990
No.

20:58.040 --> 21:00.610
They're not my allies. They're enemies.

21:00.610 --> 21:04.870
Incredible! You're still sane 
after enduring Rien's research.

21:04.870 --> 21:07.390
They're still hiding nearby.

21:07.390 --> 21:09.640
They must plan to come here eventually.

21:09.640 --> 21:11.000
How do you know that?

21:11.000 --> 21:15.250
I can feel my brother's tao among them.

21:15.570 --> 21:18.920
<i>I can sense Toma's more clearly 
since I injured him.</i>

21:19.130 --> 21:22.010
They're probably Mu Dan's killers.

21:22.010 --> 21:26.260
There are few opportunities 
to acquire this much tao.

21:26.260 --> 21:29.770
We will conduct the Hekiji Fukusho ritual.

21:29.770 --> 21:32.020
Capture the humans.

21:32.020 --> 21:35.470
What shall we do with 
the newcomers, Brother?

21:35.470 --> 21:37.860
Continue letting the doshi handle them.

21:37.860 --> 21:40.360
They're heading this way.

21:40.360 --> 21:43.030
There's no need to hunt them down.

21:43.030 --> 21:45.370
I'll let you know when they're here.

21:46.210 --> 21:47.490
Are you certain?

21:48.160 --> 21:51.320
I told you, I can feel them.

21:51.320 --> 21:53.750
But I have one condition.

21:54.680 --> 21:55.950
Very well.

21:58.630 --> 22:03.260
That's why we've been 
waiting here for you,

22:04.480 --> 22:07.510
offerings for the Hekiji Fukusho ritual.

22:08.100 --> 22:09.640
Hekiji...?

22:09.640 --> 22:15.280
A ritual in which we gather 
high quality tao of all attributes

22:15.280 --> 22:17.900
and offer them to the Grandmaster.

22:17.900 --> 22:21.410
In other words, you're the offerings.

22:26.410 --> 22:30.520
Your allies have probably 
been separated by now.

22:34.170 --> 22:37.430
The Tensen will capture them ourselves.

22:41.240 --> 22:45.760
One by one, we'll deal with you carefully.

22:46.430 --> 22:49.290
That is the Hekiji Fukusho ritual.

22:49.750 --> 22:53.200
I'm sure you had your own plans,

22:53.200 --> 22:54.590
but it was all for nothing.

22:55.970 --> 22:58.860
Whatever you do, don't fight the Tensen.

22:58.860 --> 23:01.320
If we do, our plan will fail.

23:01.320 --> 23:02.690
Gabimaru.

23:06.200 --> 23:07.490
It's over.

23:08.010 --> 23:14.140
<i>On the other side, even today</i>

23:14.140 --> 23:20.100
<i>Someone is unraveling, 
yet they still stand</i>

23:20.100 --> 23:26.010
<i>A stab to the chest, this loneliness</i>

23:26.010 --> 23:31.840
<i>Points and lines, 
breaking off and vanishing</i>

23:31.840 --> 23:34.740
<i>My shattered mask</i>

23:34.740 --> 23:37.820
<i>It's more than I can bear</i>

23:37.820 --> 23:40.810
<i>But I must keep on living</i>

23:40.810 --> 23:45.600
<i>Tomorrow awaits to greet me</i>

23:45.600 --> 23:48.560
<i>It's endless</i>

23:48.560 --> 23:51.130
<i>And so fragile</i>

23:51.130 --> 23:57.360
<i>Is it better to believe 
hearts don't exist at all?</i>

23:57.360 --> 24:02.920
<i>Radiant and soft</i>

24:02.920 --> 24:04.630
<i>Was the hand</i>

24:04.630 --> 24:13.210
<i>I squeezed back on that day</i>
